/2483760/extras/7ff0c8883e0209009b08aa90768ed4cb.avif?t=1750044089\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Events and Details</h2>The game includes a total of 165 talismans, including artifacts, regular talismans, secret talismans, and demonic talismans. There are 40 Heavenly Tribulation events that occur unpredictably during the game, which can significantly impact the current status of all players, especially when used against specific opponents. Additionally, there are 7 sets of character skills to further enhance gameplay strategy. The game features 11 immortal sects: Penglai Wonderland, Bone Refining Pool, Sky Battle Cliff, Purple Bamboo Forest, Netherworld, Old Book Pavilion, Qiankun Platform, Medicine Hall, Treasure Vault, Danxia Palace, and Heavenly Tower; and 7 mystical realms: Demon Cave, Inner Demons, Heavenly Inquiry Pavilion, Pavilion of Righteousness, Blessed Land, Miasma, and Cataclysm.",
